//! `imasm_core::imasm16_3::Reg16_3` is a plain 4-bool tuple over the lanes
//! [T, F, t, f], and every lattice op on it (`union`, `meet_t`, `join_t`,
//! `meet_c`, `join_c`, `leq_i`, `leq_t`, `leq_c`, `truth_swap`, `info_swap`,
